---------------------------- MODULE MCSmith ----------------------------
(* A Smith-type substitution: 1 |-> 2, 2 |-> 13, 3 |-> 1312.
   EXPECTED: all invariants hold. *)
EXTENDS BPA

SigmaDef == [a \in {1, 2, 3} |->
    CASE a = 1 -> <<2>>
      [] a = 2 -> <<1, 3>>
      [] a = 3 -> <<1, 3, 1, 2>>]
=============================================================================
